   Profile-likelihood intervals \tab \code{fit$profile_scale_est}, \code{summary(fit, profile = TRUE)} \tab Map units \cr
}


The \emph{effective distance} converts sigma into the distance that contains a
set proportion (by default 90 percent) of the kernel's total weight, which
is usually the easiest number to report. See \link{multiScaleR-kernels}.
